## Input

```css
@media (min-width: 16px), (min-width: -16px), (min-width: +16px) {
  .lengths { display: block; }
}

@media (aspect-ratio: 16 / 9) {
  .ratio { display: block; }
}

@media (-16px < width <= +800px), (width >= 400px), (800px > width) {
  .ranges { display: block; }
}

@media (min-width: calc(800px - 16px)) {
  .calculation { display: block; }
}

@container (min-width: -16px) {
  .container { display: block; }
}

.after { color: blue; }

```


